BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Bay/Free] Free Civic Center Tree Lighting: 50-Foot Fir + Santa (S
 F)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261202T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261202T210000
DTSTAMP:20261117T152657Z
UID:funcheap-20261202-freeciviccentertreelight
CATEGORIES:community,free
DESCRIPTION:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-civic-center-tree-lighting-50foot
 -fir-santa-sf/\nVenue: kids (and kids at heart) can twirl and dance throug
 h the falling snow\, while in\nPrice: Free\nCategories: community\, free\n
 Source: funcheap/san-francisco\n\nGet ready to kick off the holiday season
  at San Francisco’s Civic Center Plaza Holiday Tree Lighting 2026! For o
 ver 100 years an illuminated tree has stood in San Francisco’s Civic Cen
 ter Plaza during the holidays. This year be a part of the tradition at the
  annual San Francisco Civic Center Plaza Tree Lighting on Wednesday\, Dece
 mber 2\, 4-7pm! The event also features “snow” flurries \, where kids 
 (and kids at heart) can twirl and dance through the falling snow\, while i
 n the Makers Village enjoy holiday-themed activities with SF Etsy and a ch
 ildren’s book giveaway from the SF Public Library. Civic Center Tree Lig
 hting Wednesday\, December 2\, 2026 | 4-7p Civic Center Plaza\, 335 McAlli
 ster St\, SF FREE – All ages | Bites will be available for purchase\, al
